obinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9e711ddb72efdf50\" href=\"?note=9e711ddb72efdf50\" title=\"88-df-godel-sentence\">88-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"75bb18f474452a05\" href=\"?note=75bb18f474452a05\" title=\"88-df-incompleteness-theorems\">88-df-incompleteness-theorems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (formal theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\)</span> (Gödel-numbering predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\\)</span> (effective inference rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span> (consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(v)\">\\(\\Pr(v)\\)</span> (standard provability formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (Gödel sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"9e711ddb72efdf50\" href=\"?note=9e711ddb72efdf50\" title=\"88-df-godel-sentence\">88-df-godel-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(G)\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span> (omega-consistency predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\\)</span> 的公理与规则包含条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>；仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}\\)</span> 并不提供这些逻辑规则。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel\\text{-}independent} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\n\\land\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{GodelSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash_R G\\land T\\nvdash_R\\neg G\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel\\text{-}independent} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\n\\land\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{GodelSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash_R G\\land T\\nvdash_R\\neg G\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> : 相对于明确的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr\">\\(\\Pr\\)</span>之 Gödel 句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> : 可证明</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性已由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"75bb18f474452a05\" href=\"?note=75bb18f474452a05\" title=\"88-df-incompleteness-theorems\">88-df-incompleteness-theorems</a>独立定义；普通一致性只保证标准 Gödel 句不可证，并不足以保证其否定不可证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"b3bba05b63c0ebbf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"3f44d69945b890a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","an